window.docContents[202].resolve({"/Evidence-and-selected-direct-proof-calls/#Fluctuations-of-Riesz-gases--Evidence-and-selected-direct-proof-calls--What-has-been-checked":{"contents":"The supplied Lean package compiles. The ten proved declarations displayed in the two reading chapters were also checked for their axioms: each uses only propext, Classical.choice and Quot.sound. This is a check of those ten declarations. The original statements with admitted proofs (sorry) are identified separately, together with the proved declarations and their type checks.\n\nThe English statements and proof explanations have a separate, scoped correspondence review. The source links below identify the formal results on which they depend.\n\n","context":"Fluctuations of Riesz gases\u0009Evidence and selected direct proof calls","header":"4.1. What has been checked","id":"/Evidence-and-selected-direct-proof-calls/#Fluctuations-of-Riesz-gases--Evidence-and-selected-direct-proof-calls--What-has-been-checked"}});